## # i18n/yaml_loader
##
## Flat YAML translation loader (string values only).
## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).
##
## Translation YAML is a flat mapping of string values (`title: Ciao`).
## Quote every value: unquoted scalars arrive typed and cannot be pinned
## safely, so only quoted strings are consumed.

import "yaml" as yaml_pkg

## Parses flat YAML translation text into a key -> template map.
##
## ### Parameters
## - `text`: Raw YAML mapping content.
##
## ### Returns
## Flat map of translation keys to template strings.
pub function parse_yaml_text(text) -> map
    let out = map()
    if text is null or len(text) == 0
        return out
    end
    let data = yaml_pkg::parse(text)
    if data is null
        return out
    end
    for k in keys(data)
        out[k] = str_from_ptr(data[k])
    end
    return out
end
